    "sections": {
        "description": "The FSE Church Theme is a modern, elegant, faith-focused, and multipurpose website solution designed for churches, baptist ministries, nonprofits, Christian groups, religious institutions, and charity organizations, making it ideal for creating church websites with a professional and inspiring design. As a fully Gutenberg-optimized, block-based Religious theme, it works as a powerful church website builder known for ease of use and flexibility. Featuring a clean, minimal, and visually engaging layout, it keeps your message central while delivering a refined browsing experience. Its responsive, retina-ready, and mobile-friendly design ensures seamless performance across devices, while fast-loading and SEO-optimized code improves navigation and visibility. Built on Bootstrap, it offers flexible styling, modern UI components, and interactive elements. Customization is simple with controls for colors, typography, and layouts without coding. It includes sections for banners, testimonials, leadership profiles, events, sermons, and social media integration, making it suitable for growing ministries and community-focused platforms."
    },
